  "body": "https://mikewest.github.io/corpp/ specifies the value \"none\" as being equivalent to no header present.\r\n\r\nhttps://gist.github.com/annevk/6f2dd8c79c77123f39797f6bdac43f3e calls its none value \"unsafe-none\".\r\n\r\nSince these headers are closely related, I think consistency in their naming would be nice.\r\n\r\n@annevk @mikewest @jugglinmike ",
